23:07.880 --> 23:08.640
Pergilah.

23:19.890 --> 23:25.620
[Kediaman Ji]

23:49.130 --> 23:52.350
[Kediaman Ji]

23:49.440 --> 23:50.370
Semuanya ikuti.

24:07.030 --> 24:08.590
