Nenek.

24:10.110 --> 24:11.110
Nenek.

24:16.240 --> 24:17.350
Nenek.

24:21.540 --> 24:25.680
[Kediaman Ji]

24:41.150 --> 24:43.820
[Kediaman Ji]

24:47.040 --> 24:49.250
[Kediaman Ji]

24:56.750 --> 24:57.720
Nenek.

