30:38.450 --> 30:40.520
[Kediaman Gu di Ibu Kota]

30:40.540 --> 30:40.660
[Kediaman Gu]

30:43.590 --> 30:45.240
Kakak Pewaris sungguh pergi

30:45.240 --> 30:47.840
